{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vitrified is a post-apocalyptic metroidvania where progress depends on teamwork with your robot pal ALAN. Explore a mysterious mutant wasteland and upgrade ALAN with abilities to unlock new areas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/8ad06886489e341d1ee22fe84264da84.poster.avif?t=1763819864\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/8ad06886489e341d1ee22fe84264da84.webm?t=1763819864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/8ad06886489e341d1ee22fe84264da84.mp4?t=1763819864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape The Wasteland</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left to die in the middle of The Wasteland, you are saved by a wandering robot that goes by the name of ALAN. Your only hope of finding your way home is to put your trust in ALAN. Together, you will battle fearsome mutated creatures, navigate harsh terrain and survive in the unforgiving wasteland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/b465137a8d703d67750a642de1fa5b99.poster.avif?t=1763819864\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/b465137a8d703d67750a642de1fa5b99.webm?t=1763819864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/b465137a8d703d67750a642de1fa5b99.mp4?t=1763819864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a mysterious mutant wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Work together with ALAN to fight mutated creatures, navigate harsh terrain and defeat powerful bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive in the desolate wasteland by seeking out food, water, and power for ALAN. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade ALAN with special abilities to unlock new areas and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/74d89a92974fe1b38b4e46c4b55eb760.poster.avif?t=1763819864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/74d89a92974fe1b38b4e46c4b55eb760.webm?t=1763819864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/74d89a92974fe1b38b4e46c4b55eb760.mp4?t=1763819864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2571610?t=1763819864","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/a63b630ff97ef9b2803700ae648dcf0d082c808a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763819864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/4dea266bda096822c76c4ce624937719f91a3e4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763819864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/4dea266bda096822c76c4ce624937719f91a3e4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763819864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support"